<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 282-4 AT LUNCH ON 3RD DAY VS NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 282-4 AT LUNCH ON 3RD DAY VS NZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 282 for four wickets at lunch in reply to New Zealand's first innings total of 124 on the third day of the second test on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 124 (D.Patel 45, D.Gough 5-40, A.Caddick 4-45).</p>
<p>England first innings 282 for four wickets (N.Hussain 64, G.Thorpe 85 not out).</p>
